    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Using these weights, updated estimates of the means and variance are obtained as above, and these are substituted back into Equation A4.24 to obtain new weights. This procedure is continued until the iterations converge. Ranging through all possible values of c and plotting the resulting maximum of the likelihood function for each c value thus generates a likelihood map for c.",
